  "titel": "Stocks vs Bonds - What's the Difference?",
  "beschreibung": "This episode breaks down stocks and bonds, two of the most common ways people put money into the economy. It explains what each one really represents, how money moves between investors and companies or governments, and what risks and rewards come with each. The video also covers how long money stays tied up, what fees and taxes apply, and which situations each option tends to fit. No specific investments are recommended, only the mechanics and differences are explained.\n\n#stocks #bonds #investing #finance #economics\n\nThis video explains two terms and how they differ. It is not financial advice and not a recommendation to buy or sell anything.",
